<title>FINLAND: HELIBOR INTEREST RATES LOWER AT CENTRAL BANK FIX.</title>
<headline>HELIBOR INTEREST RATES LOWER AT CENTRAL BANK FIX.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Helibor interest rates fell at</p>
<p>the Bank of Finland's daily fixing on Monday. The three-month</p>
<p>rate fell two basis points to 3.07 percent.</p>
<p>				  December 16 fix     December 13 fix</p>
<p> 1-mth Helibor		   3.01 pct		3.02 pct</p>
<p> 2-mth Helibor		   3.04 pct		3.06 pct</p>
<p> 3-mth Helibor		   3.07 pct		3.09 pct</p>
<p> 6-mth Helibor		   3.20 pct		3.21 pct</p>
<p> 9-mth Helibor		   3.31 pct		3.33 pct</p>
<p> 12-mth Helibor		  3.41 pct		3.44 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 245</p>
</text>
